From 0c6ae59fd7c112f615f73a3a478fb3f7ff1bcef6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 09:51:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD selected-agent slash command execution to keep
 commands out of normal sends

Route slash-prefixed selected-agent chat through a provider-neutral backend command hook so actions such as status and fork are handled by the active provider instead of the ordinary prompt-send path. Backends that do not expose native command actions return a clear unsupported-command reply by default.
